WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
System design review. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Defend a coherent powertrain concept

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A powertrain review follows energy, torque, heat, support loads, interfaces and failure evidence together. No isolated ratio proves the whole design works.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Trace one requirement from engine output through gearbox and differential to the tire, noting assumptions at each interface.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Evidence-based design brief

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Ideal mechanism only; friction, heat and part-specific behavior need measurements.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Defend a coherent powertrain concept
